{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2024-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1718496000, "end_date": 1719187199, "month_true_total": 617, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:52:06 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "168046682", "author": {"steamid": "76561199052009277", "personaname": "ComodinoSpigoloso", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199052009277/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2408, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2386, "last_played": 1731785174, "avatar": "1b5d23e704b5539ceb6b36bc00eaa5ea4584577b"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is not L4D, stop hating this game", "timestamp_created": 1719183835, "timestamp_updated": 1719183835, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.553661346435546875", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168045567", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041463308", "personaname": "Zetta", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zetta_og/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 798, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 216, "last_played": 1769492081, "avatar": "bd4b076cd1a5d6c2991a521f8db2b8a3379775f9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Perfect example of don't hop on the bandwagon. Try it for yourself and see if you enjoy it.\n\nI tried this game when it first came out, and it was in a pretty bad state. I was one of the ones who didn't purchase on release.\nDecided to give it a go on sale and was pleasantly surprised by the experience. Game is vastly improved and pretty fun with friends. \n\nYou wont be blown away by gunplay or physics, but what the game tries to achieve is not executed badly.\n\n-Deck Builder/Card system is a nice twist to the genre\n-Difficulty modifiers are very in depth, combine that with the cards and you have a pretty in-depth system that promotes unique playthroughs\n-Great variety of weapons and attachments, with a ton of modifiers depending on rarity\n-Many different playstyles\n\nI would still advise to wait for sale. Lower your expectations, and enjoy it for what it does well. If you do catch a sale, it is well worth it!", "timestamp_created": 1719182512, "timestamp_updated": 1719182512, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168042175", "author": {"steamid": "76561198144479292", "personaname": "Jonton", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198144479292/", "num_games_owned": 182, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 706, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 464, "deck_playtime_at_review": 28, "last_played": 1779689357, "avatar": "2a276cd024a3b5c2b92b16e86e0981c39a45efc0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I think that is worth given it a try specially now on sale and after all the updates that it has especially if u have friends to play with.", "timestamp_created": 1719178789, "timestamp_updated": 1719178789, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168039782", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993463479", "personaname": "BigJuicey", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993463479/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1177, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 285, "last_played": 1724630002, "avatar": "ee807ee8a5032aecdb7ab31a0f4624790a26b4a4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really enjoying it having never played when it first came out.  UI and intro to all the mechanics still needs work, it's massively overwhelming to figure out all the bells and whistles.  But gameplay is really fun with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1719176360, "timestamp_updated": 1719176360, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168036624", "author": {"steamid": "76561198829597576", "personaname": "ClutchUp08", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/clutchup08/", "num_games_owned": 369, "num_reviews": 82, "playtime_forever": 446, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 90, "last_played": 1769661201, "avatar": "b32e8a90956cc94ada60e51f6f966e6f9b61e597"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game was grossly overhated seeing that it's actually genuinely fun for what it is but people had to ruin it by constantly shredding it for \"not being as good as left 4 dead\" and while yes it isn't as good this game on it's own is great and fun and definitely worth playing", "timestamp_created": 1719173439, "timestamp_updated": 1719173439, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168033268", "author